{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ve been pulled into the mysterious Neko Dimension after a glitch in a Claw Machine game. Here, trapped girls fight to reclaim their freedom by collecting figurines of themselves. Help your favorite girls by winning battles, earning their affection, and unlocking unique figurines with countless outfits and variations.</strong><br><br><strong>Battle in Claw Machines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in fast-paced Auto Chess-style battles inside a giant Claw Machine. Grab orbs, outsmart your opponent, and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/8f0f1f5ff815235033c13f339a2d7368.poster.avif?t=1758638580\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/8f0f1f5ff815235033c13f339a2d7368.webm?t=1758638580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/8f0f1f5ff815235033c13f339a2d7368.mp4?t=1758638580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect girls, outfits, and figurines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch orbs at the store\u2019s Claw Machine to unlock new girls, outfits, and collectible figurines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/e5ad3de50cacbae288d871c7f28983d5.poster.avif?t=1758638580\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/e5ad3de50cacbae288d871c7f28983d5.webm?t=1758638580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea